@startuml fig-udp-header
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
title UDP header: fields in wire order (RFC 768)
note as header
|= Bit offset |= Width (bits) |= Field |
| 0 | 16 | Source Port |
| 16 | 16 | Destination Port |
| 32 | 16 | Length: header + payload (octets) |
| 48 | 16 | Checksum |

Fixed header: 64 bits (8 bytes).
Checksum is optional for IPv4, normally required for IPv6.
The 16-bit length covers up to 65,535 octets; IP limits may be lower.
IPv6 jumbograms use separately specified rules.
end note
@enduml
